{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2394930/extras/tg_steam_240528.gif?t=1716909079\" /><br><br>Join our protagonist, Simon - a passenger without a ticket, on an exciting train adventure to get to the capital city. You will have to be smart in order to get a place to sleep during this long trip. <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2394930/extras/tg_steam_240528-2.gif?t=1716909079\" /><br><br>There are multiple ways to finish almost every level. But you have to speak with passangers carefully and don't forget to use inventory.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2394930/extras/ezgif-4-55fd89af38.gif?t=1716909079\" /><br><br>Choose wisely, your actions influence the final. Help Simon reach the capital in better condition.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2394930?t=1716909079","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2394930?t=1716909079","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2394930/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1716909079","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2394930/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1716909079","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Talk to passengers, but wisely! Choices made in the dialogue system influence the plot and the ending especially. Beware - some words thrown may throw you off the train.<br></li><li> Can't open a door? Look at your inventory, and try to drag and drop things from it on a scene.<br></li><li> Explore level - point over things in the car, maybe some of them can be picked up, and so